STRICT JSON OUTPUT REQUIREMENT:
You MUST respond ONLY with a valid, parseable JSON object matching this schema. DO NOT add conversational text or markdown code fences outside the JSON object:
{
  "commentary": "Markdown-formatted explanation for the chat: summarize what was evaluated, what strategic improvements and new sections were crafted, and why this enhances reader engagement and SEO.",
